flowchart TD
    CLI["userspace add prefix<br/><b>does:</b> converts CIDR into<br/>LPM key {prefixlen, addr}<br/><b>why next:</b> map update persists<br/>policy for live XDP program<br/><b>state:</b> canonical key bytes"]
    Update["bpf_map_update_elem<br/><b>does:</b> inserts/updates<br/>LPM trie node<br/><b>why next:</b> future lookups<br/>see new policy immediately<br/><b>state:</b> trie has prefix and value"]
    Packet["packet at XDP<br/><b>does:</b> extracts src/dst<br/>address into lookup key<br/><b>why next:</b> policy decision<br/>is map-driven<br/><b>state:</b> full-length key for<br/>longest-prefix search"]
    Lookup["LPM trie lookup<br/><b>does:</b> walks from broad<br/>prefixes to most-specific match<br/><b>why next:</b> returned value<br/>determines verdict<br/><b>state:</b> best match or miss"]
    Verdict{"policy value?"}
    Drop["XDP_DROP<br/><b>does:</b> consumes packet<br/>before skb allocation<br/><b>state:</b> denied prefix blocked"]
    Pass["XDP_PASS<br/><b>does:</b> hands packet<br/>to normal stack<br/><b>state:</b> no deny match<br/>or allow value"]

    CLI --> Update
    Update -. shared map state .-> Lookup
    Packet --> Lookup --> Verdict
    Verdict -->|deny| Drop
    Verdict -->|miss/allow| Pass

    classDef us fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb
    classDef bpf fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706
    classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a
    classDef bad fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626
    class CLI,Update us
    class Packet,Lookup,Verdict bpf
    class Pass ok
    class Drop bad
